                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "anchor": "_Toc23436"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.1 Introduction of the product",
                        "style": [
                            "bold"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "level": 3
            },
            "anchor": "_Toc30149"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "This product is a high-tech infra-red (IR) thermometer designed to take human body temperature by measuring the energy of IR emitted from the forehead. The product will help you to assess you and your family members’ health conditions easily and quickly."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "anchor": "_Toc3055"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.2 Introduction on implementation of the risk management plan",
                        "style": [
                            "bold"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "level": 3
            },
            "anchor": "_Toc31475"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The risk management activity including the risk management plan was began at the time the project is approved."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "anchor": "_Toc4045"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The risk management plan has defined the acceptance criteria of risk, and has also arranged the risk management review activity. The risk management group is established to ensure the risk management activity of the current project will be implemented effectively according to the risk management plan."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "On the development phase and prototype phase of the Infrared Forehead Thermometer, the risk management group reviewed the risk management respectively, and documented the risk management files."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The objective of this review is to take a complete evaluation on risk management activity performed on each phase before the product is marketed, to ensure that the risk management plan has been accomplished.  And according to evaluating the risk analysis, risk assessment and control, and the acceptance of the residual risk, to ensure that all the risks has been managed and all the residual risk can be accepted."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
