        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "clinical safety outcomes can prove that the product is safe; clinical performance outcomes can prove that  PT9L can achieve its intended use. Users can benefit from proper use, benefits outweigh the overall residual risks,so the overall residual risks are acceptable."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Risk Management Group has reviewed the PT9L, and concluded the following:"
