        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The risk management process has been implemented according to the criteria established in the risk \tmanagement plan standards,the risk team have considered the efficiency and safety of the \tproduct,and think that all the identified risks have been controlled as far as possible."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "——Residual risks are acceptable:"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "All single residual risks are in the “Acceptable” area. And the distribution of all the residual risks less \tthan 1/2 of the overall residual risks are in the higher severity regions or in the higher probability \tregions. And the clusters of all the residual risks are not borderline.Compared with the intended benefits for PT9L ,the benefits outweigh the overall residual risks, So the overall residual risks are \talso acceptable."
